title: TIP calls a vote of no confidence
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: CHP_in_government = 1 and TIP_in_government = 1 and TIP_coalition_dissent >= 4 and not constructive_vonc

= Coalition in Crisis

TIP calls for a vote of no confidence after disagreements within the coalition.

- @negotiate: Negotiate a compromise with TIP.
- @alternatives: Look for another parliamentary majority.
- @fall: Accept the government's fall.

@negotiate
choose-if: resources >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 3 resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 3; TIP_coalition_dissent -= 2

Negotiations ease the immediate dispute, but our policy disagreements remain.

@alternatives

- @national_elections.coalition_menu: Review the coalition possibilities.
- @fall: Accept the government's fall.

@fall
on-arrival: TIP_relation -= 8; TIP_in_government = 0; TIP_coalition_dissent = 0; in_left_front = 0
go-to: vote_of_no_confidence.caretaker
